      "text": [
        " : سَأَلْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ عَنْ ذَبِيحَةِ اَلْمَرْأَةِ فَقَالَ \"إِنْ كُنَّ نِسَاءً لَيْسَ مَعَهُنَّ رَجُلٌ فَلْتَذْبَحْ أَعْلَمُهُنَّ وَ لْتَذْكُرِ اِسْمَ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ\" وَ سَأَلْتُهُ عَنْ ذَبِيحَةِ اَلصَّبِيِّ فَقَالَ \"إِذَا تَحَرَّكَ وَ كَانَ خَمْسَةَ أَشْبَارٍ وَ أَطَاقَ اَلشَّفْرَةَ \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4190 - And Hammad narrated from Hariz, from Muhammad ibn Muslim, who said:\nI asked Abu Abdullah (as), about the slaughtering done by a woman.\nImam (as) said: \"If they are women and there is no man among them, then the most knowledgeable one among them should slaughter and mention the name of Allah (swt) upon it.\"\nAnd I asked Imam (as) about the slaughtering done by a boy.\nImam (as) said: \"If he has reached the age where he can move, is five spans tall, and can handle the knife, then it is permissible.\""
        ]
      }
